# p5 mcp: what fx sends the stdio fixture (initialize, tools/list,
# tools/call), logged by the fixture, for one search-and-call turn. v0.0.16
# passes a stdio server only HOME LOGNAME PATH SHELL TERM USER, so the log
# path goes in the server's own env (MCPSTDIO_WIRE_LOG,
# p5-mcp-wire-profile.json); `home wire` reads the log.
# The stdio server is p5-mcp-stdio.ts, which the profile names by `@BUN@` and
# `@SCENARIOS@` (capture.sh writes both in), and xfx is given the same profile.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-wire-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-wire-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-turns.json
env MCPSTDIO_WIRE_LOG=@HOME@/p5-mcp-wire.ndjson
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=full-access
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 6
type use the fixture echo tool
key Enter
wait 15
snap turn
home wire
